# Local-only overrides and secrets for `astro dev` / `wrangler dev`.
# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored). Values here override "vars" from wrangler.jsonc.
# Production secrets go in with: npx wrangler secret put NAME --env production

# PUBLIC_SITE_ENV=dev
# Design direction to run locally: neon-muhely (A) or galeria-editorial (B).
# SITE_THEME=galeria-editorial
# ORDER_NOTIFY_EMAIL=stiletdekor@gmail.com
# Comma-separated extra origins accepted by POST /api/* (the site's own origin is always allowed).
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:4321
